1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,152
Business Case One follows one controlled hiring need from manager-owned
demand to a candidate-visible job.

2
00:00:06,152 --> 00:00:13,124
Requisition R E Q Demo zero zero one creates two approved openings for a
Senior Product Designer.

3
00:00:13,124 --> 00:00:16,405
Finance and Compensation independently approve the exact version.

4
00:00:16,405 --> 00:00:27,888
Recruiting configures job J O B Demo zero zero one, publishes posting
version seven, reconciles four delivery channels and proves the result
in analytics and the handoff inbox.

5
00:00:27,888 --> 00:00:33,220
Every person and action is synthetic, browser-memory only, and creates
no external effect.

6
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:38,390
The level-two data-flow diagram establishes the contract before we touch
the interface.

7
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:47,007
Each highlighted process names its actor, product route, action, input,
output, business object, event, governed store, rule, denial and
recovery.

8
00:00:47,007 --> 00:00:55,193
The moving token shows the record progressing without collapsing
requisition, job, opening, posting and delivery into one mutable object.

9
00:00:55,193 --> 00:01:01,328
The hiring manager records workforce plan, position, location, two
openings, target date and justification.

10
00:01:01,328 --> 00:01:06,586
The output is versioned requisition draft three in the workforce demand
ledger.

11
00:01:06,586 --> 00:01:10,530
Unavailable or duplicate headcount returns to a safe draft.

12
00:01:10,530 --> 00:01:17,280
Submission binds the current justification, budget reference, level and
compensation evidence to requisition version three.

13
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:24,030
Missing or stale evidence blocks the submission with field-level repair
guidance and preserves earlier history.

14
00:01:24,030 --> 00:01:26,117
Finance approves headcount and budget.

15
00:01:26,117 --> 00:01:28,205
Compensation then approves the band.

16
00:01:28,205 --> 00:01:33,214
Neither approver can silently bypass the other or approve a changed
version.

17
00:01:33,214 --> 00:01:36,554
The final output is attributed requisition version four.

18
00:01:36,554 --> 00:01:42,681
Recruiting converts approved demand into one Senior Product Designer job
and two separate opening records.

19
00:01:42,681 --> 00:01:49,216
Candidate content, hiring plan and policy readiness must reconcile to
the same approved demand before publication.

20
00:01:49,216 --> 00:01:54,687
Posting version seven is immutable and each destination receives its own
delivery receipt.

21
00:01:54,687 --> 00:01:58,475
A stale channel is retried without duplicating successful deliveries.

22
00:01:58,475 --> 00:02:03,525
The public page, events, analytics and handoffs remain traceable to
approved demand.

23
00:02:03,525 --> 00:02:06,773
We begin on the actual manager recruiting route.

24
00:02:06,773 --> 00:02:14,078
The record identity is R E Q Demo zero zero one and its state is Draft
version three.

25
00:02:14,078 --> 00:02:25,849
The manager can see the FY twenty-seven workforce plan, Senior Product
Designer position, California remote location, two named openings,
November sixteenth target start, current headcount reference and
business justification.

26
00:02:25,849 --> 00:02:33,155
The boundary panel makes the control explicit: this actor submits demand
but cannot self-approve Finance or Compensation evidence.

27
00:02:33,155 --> 00:02:38,813
The connected requisition workbench repeats the authoritative data and
displays each field classification.

28
00:02:38,813 --> 00:02:45,776
With Hiring Manager selected, the budget and compensation evidence is
visible only for this approved purpose.

29
00:02:45,776 --> 00:02:48,387
The manager submits the exact version.

30
00:02:48,387 --> 00:02:57,526
The receipt records Draft version three to Submitted version three, the
Requisition Submitted event, the actor, correlation key and Finance
handoff.

31
00:02:57,526 --> 00:02:59,996
The persona changes to Finance Approver.

32
00:02:59,996 --> 00:03:07,407
The workbench preserves the same requisition and version while limiting
the decision to current headcount and budget evidence.

33
00:03:07,407 --> 00:03:18,111
Recording Finance approval creates an attributed event and moves the
same version to Compensation review; it does not publish a job or
overwrite the manager submission.

34
00:03:18,111 --> 00:03:26,010
Compensation Approver now reviews the one hundred sixty-eight to one
hundred ninety-six thousand dollar band against the same version.

35
00:03:26,010 --> 00:03:31,414
The final approval creates requisition version four and hands minimum
context to Recruiting.

36
00:03:31,414 --> 00:03:35,986
Three separate receipts now prove submission, Finance approval and
Compensation approval.

37
00:03:35,986 --> 00:03:39,088
The recruiter opens the actual job edit route.

38
00:03:39,088 --> 00:03:48,392
Senior Product Designer, Product and Research, California remote,
full-time employment, compensation, owner, URL slug, role summary and
structured requirements are editable within role scope.

39
00:03:48,392 --> 00:03:52,656
Lifecycle state remains governed and cannot be changed in this form.

40
00:03:52,656 --> 00:03:59,634
Two approved openings, O P N zero zero one and zero zero two, are
visible as separate seats.

41
00:03:59,634 --> 00:04:01,960
Saving returns to the readiness workspace.

42
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:04,976
The job is Approved, not already Published.

43
00:04:04,976 --> 00:04:13,163
The effective plan is posting draft version seven, and opening
reconciliation shows two approved, zero reserved and zero filled.

44
00:04:13,163 --> 00:04:16,611
The Golden Path scenario removes unrelated scorecard noise.

45
00:04:16,611 --> 00:04:23,505
Readiness reaches one hundred percent because opening, team, plan, pay,
content and jurisdiction facts are current.

46
00:04:23,505 --> 00:04:42,534
The publication workbench keeps every grain explicit: approved
requisition version four; job J O B Demo zero zero one; openings O P N
zero zero one and zero zero two; English United States posting P S T
Demo zero zero one; immutable posting version seven; and Careers,
LinkedIn, Indeed and Agency destinations.

47
00:04:42,534 --> 00:04:46,559
Before release, every channel is prepared but has no delivery receipt.

48
00:04:46,559 --> 00:04:48,556
The recruiter publishes version seven.

49
00:04:48,556 --> 00:04:56,142
The workbench becomes Published and reconciled, the Job Posting Version
Published event is recorded, and four delivery receipts appear.

50
00:04:56,142 --> 00:05:03,329
The actual job record now changes from Approved to Published, with two
openings and posting version seven preserved.

51
00:05:03,329 --> 00:05:05,725
No external job board is contacted.

52
00:05:05,725 --> 00:05:10,361
We follow the public-preview action into the employer-branded careers
experience.

53
00:05:10,361 --> 00:05:20,098
Candidates see Senior Product Designer, the correct location, employment
type, team, compensation range, structured requirements, process
expectations and private support route.

54
00:05:20,098 --> 00:05:24,271
Internal approvals, budget evidence and channel operations remain
absent.

55
00:05:24,271 --> 00:05:28,907
This is the candidate-safe projection of the same published record.

56
00:05:28,907 --> 00:05:33,235
Back in the publication workbench, we simulate a channel mismatch.

57
00:05:33,235 --> 00:05:40,159
Careers, Indeed and Agency retain successful version-seven receipts,
while LinkedIn is isolated at stale version six.

58
00:05:40,159 --> 00:05:50,112
The state becomes blocked for reconciliation, an owned failure receipt
is created, and unsupported downstream action stops without withdrawing
the valid public page.

59
00:05:50,112 --> 00:05:53,154
The recruiter reconciles only the failed channel.

60
00:05:53,154 --> 00:06:00,974
LinkedIn advances from version six to version seven using the existing
business context; successful destinations are not duplicated.

61
00:06:00,974 --> 00:06:08,794
A recovery event and restatement receipt retain the failure history
while returning the publication to a reconciled state.

62
00:06:08,794 --> 00:06:15,290
The control center derives readiness, blocked work, events, handoffs and
restatements from the same browser-memory ledger.

63
00:06:15,290 --> 00:06:22,599
The Business Case One rows show the approval sequence, publication
failure and recovery rather than decorative sample numbers.

64
00:06:22,599 --> 00:06:29,501
We drill to the exact feature record, previous and current state, latest
event and correlated audit timeline.

65
00:06:29,501 --> 00:06:36,356
The handoff inbox shows Finance, Compensation, Recruiting, recovery and
candidate-facing work with minimum context.

66
00:06:36,356 --> 00:06:41,252
Each card retains actor, destination, record, event and correlation key.

67
00:06:41,252 --> 00:06:49,575
We acknowledge the current recruiter handoff, producing a visible
completed state without fabricating email or workflow-provider delivery.

68
00:06:49,575 --> 00:06:51,995
Business Case One is complete.

69
00:06:51,995 --> 00:06:58,288
One manager-owned requisition became approved version four through
independent Finance and Compensation decisions.

70
00:06:58,288 --> 00:07:12,809
Recruiting configured one Senior Product Designer job and two openings,
published immutable posting version seven, proved the candidate-facing
page, recovered one stale channel, reconciled analytics and acknowledged
the next-actor handoff.

71
00:07:12,809 --> 00:07:18,133
Production identity, persistence, APIs and real delivery remain separate
implementation gates.
